contractRequests:
Spec 01 req 8 and 10, and the configuration-model 'Restricted YAML profile' section (outside WP-33's paths). Please list these new RZ-CFG-001 refusals, or record them as an OQ row:
- a flow entry with more than an optional '?', one node, one ':' and one node;
- a ':' in a flow collection followed by a character a plain scalar holds, after a node that is not a quoted scalar or a flow collection;
- a plain scalar in a flow collection that ends with ':' right before a flow indicator;
- a block mapping key after a tab on its line;
- a mapping entry at a block sequence's column that no mapping at that column holds;
- a block value on a later line at or left of its entry's column, except a block sequence under a mapping key;
- a block scalar header with more than one chomping and one indentation indicator, or other text after them.

Same docs: please record the valid YAML 1.2 that goccy v1.19.2 refuses and the profile keeps refused (doc.go; TestGoccyLimitations; TestFlowEntryShape):
- flow pairs whose value is on a later line ('[a:\n b]', '[? a\n : b]', '[k:\nv]');
- empty values or explicit keys in flow sequences ('[a: ]', '[k: ,]', '[? a]');
- a ',' at the start of a line after a flow pair;
- a ':' right after a quoted key inside a flow sequence ('["a":b]');
- a plain scalar in a flow collection continued by a line starting with '-', or by another plain line;
- a tag that ends its line before a block scalar header;
- a value over several lines after a tagged implicit key or a quoted explicit key;
- an explicit key whose tag ends the '?' line;
- a tagged empty node before a sibling;
- a line of white space holding a tab between two lines of content (YAML Test Suite DK95/04), or after the last line of content.

Lead (goccy upgrade or upstream issues). This round found more goccy v1.19.2 faults; the profile works around each one without changing any value:
- every tab inside a double-quoted scalar makes the scanner step one character past the scalar's end, which loses the following line break and shifts later lines;
- a keep-chomping block scalar of blank lines makes the scanner refuse the next token;
- an indentation indicator before trailing blank lines is refused;
- a tab between a quoted key and its ':' is refused;
- while a flow mapping is open, scanMapDelim makes every ':' a value indicator;
- in flow sequences, parseMap reads entries by column and without ','.
Please weigh a goccy upgrade or upstream issues.

